Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:59.73,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威斯康辛州 曼莱托克湖）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎来到曼莱托克湖）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（密尔沃基州）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.23,0:33:31.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（相册：杰克 12岁）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那晚发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快把你弟弟带到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.64,0:00:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Dean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们亲眼目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they witnessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sent two brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从此踏上征途 22年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a quest for answers. 22 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓我再也不猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore I was done hunting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有活儿干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸唯一的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dad's single.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.75,0:00:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最有价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}most valuable possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.05,0:00:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他所知道的关于恶魔的东西都记载在这里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything he knows about every evil thing is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 拯救人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, saving people,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunting things…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.80,0:00:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得找出杀杰西卡的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.72,0:00:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我现在唯一想做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你知道我们会找到爸爸的 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you know we're gonna find Dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.90,0:00:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.89,0:01:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.78,0:01:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早安 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做的这些健身 索菲 我说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these workouts, Soph, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.78,0:01:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男生不喜欢壮硕的女生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys don't like buff girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过女生也不喜欢还住父母家的男生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, girls don't like guys who still live at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.09,0:03:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请结帐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the check, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.43,0:03:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我们可以偶尔找点乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sam, we are allowed to have fun once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.52,0:03:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是乐子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿 看这个 我想我找到了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take a look at this. I think I got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威斯康辛州 曼莱托克湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lake Manitoc, Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上周 索菲·卡尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week, Sophie Carlton,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}18岁 下水之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}18, walks into the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就再也没起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't walk out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.35,0:03:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当局彻底搜索了整个水域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authorities dragged the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么也没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索菲·卡尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophie Carlton.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是今年曼莱托克湖淹死的第三个人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the third Lake Manitoc drowning this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他人的尸体也都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the other bodies were found, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两天前他们举行了葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a funeral two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.27,0:03:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他们埋了一具空棺材\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they buried an empty coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作个了结之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for closure or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.33,0:03:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.55,0:03:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么样的了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}What closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人不是简单的失踪 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't just disappear, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.70,0:03:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们却停止了寻找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people just stop looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.44,0:04:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想跟我说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸的踪迹 最近都没音信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trail for dad. It's getting colder every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那我们该怎么办 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are we supposed to do? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总得做点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 任何事 - 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything. - You konw what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我受够了你这种态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of this attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.15,0:04:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我不像你一样想找到爸爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think I want to find dad as much as you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 我知道你也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.58,0:04:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在过去两年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one that's been with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.62,0:04:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我每一天都陪在爸爸身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}him every single day for the past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那时你却在大学里开赛前动员会\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you've been off to college going to pep rallies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会找到爸爸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在此之前 我们必须消灭这一路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}but until then, we're gonna kill everything bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}between here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.34,0:04:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 曼莱托克湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Lake Manitoc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离这多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.09,0:04:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔·卡尔顿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Carlton?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.17,0:05:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是探员福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm agent Ford.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.41,0:05:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是探员哈迈尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is agent Hamill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.24,0:05:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是美国野生动物管理局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're with the U.S. Wild Life Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她大概游了100码远\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was about 100 yards out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.83,0:05:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是她被拖下水的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where she got dragged down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定她不是溺水吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're sure she didn't just drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 她是学校的游泳健将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. She was a varsity swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她几乎在那个湖里长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}She practically grew up in that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.56,0:05:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在那儿就像在自己的浴缸里一样安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's as safe out there as in her own bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么没有水花\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no splashing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.67,0:05:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有因为痛苦自杀的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}no signs of distress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 就跟我说的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's what I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见水里有影子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see any shadows in the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.15,0:05:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个黑色的东西跃出水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}some dark shape breach the surface?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 再说一遍 她当时离得太远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, again, she was really far out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没在岸边看见什么奇怪的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see any strange tracks by the shoreline?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没 绝对没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, never.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有什么东西在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一查清楚就告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll let you know as soon as we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.86,0:05:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your father?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能和他谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we talk to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 如果你们不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, If you don't mind, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.56,0:05:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么也没看到 而且他很痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't see anything, and he's kind of been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.97,0:06:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无意冒犯 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'm sorry, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.55,0:06:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么野生动物管理局对意外溺水案有兴趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}why does the Wildlife Service care about an accidental drowning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.88,0:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定是意外吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure it's accidental?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔·卡尔顿看见有东西抓住了他姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Carlton saw something grab his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.62,0:06:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, sit, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湖里没有任何本地生的肉食动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no indigenous carnivores in that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至没有大到能拖人下水的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing even big enough to pull down a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.71,0:06:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非是尼斯湖水怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless it was the Loch Ness monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔·卡尔顿伤心欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Carlton was traumatized,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且有时候 人的思维是会捉弄人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sometimes the mind plays tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.48,0:06:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为进一步确定 我们彻底搜索了整个湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}we dragged that entire lake. We even ran a sonar sweep,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还做了声纳扫描 但是什么都没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to be sure, and there was nothing down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是今年失踪的第三具尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the third missing body this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们都是我镇上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are people from my town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.23,0:06:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是我该照顾的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are people I care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.34,0:07:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会再成问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't be a problem much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是水坝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the dam, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水坝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它漏水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It sprung a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.55,0:07:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它要塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's falling apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且政府不愿给我们资金去维修\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the feds won't give us the grant to repair it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.11,0:07:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他们开出了一条泄洪道\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they've opened the spillway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.43,0:07:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再过六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}In another six months,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湖就不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there won't be much of a lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.50,0:07:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个镇子也将不存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There won't be much of a town, either,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过作为野生动物管理局人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as federal wildlife,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们应该早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you already knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.49,0:07:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.98,0:07:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 我打扰你们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, am I interrupting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还是等会再来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think come back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 这是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, this is my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.77,0:07:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.07,0:07:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安德里亚·巴尔 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea Barrr. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是野生动物管理局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from the wildlife service,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来调查有关湖的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}about the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.48,0:07:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:07:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我外孙最近经历了太多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandson's been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都经历了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all have.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.65,0:08:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.24,0:08:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果有什么事我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there's anything else I can do for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然你这样说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, now that you mentioned it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.44,0:08:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想打听一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you point us in the.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}附近有价钱公道的旅店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}direction of a reasonably priced motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湖滨汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lakefront motel, go around the corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.03,0:08:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过两个街区就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's two blocks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.64,0:08:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以带我们过去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you mind showing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.38,0:08:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我陪你们走两个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to walk you two blocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.13,0:08:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不麻烦的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if it's any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反正我也往那个方向走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed that way anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我三点回来接卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back to pick up lucas at 3:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 我们等会去公园好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go to the park, okay, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.85,0:08:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, cute kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子是最可爱的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are the best, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.61,0:08:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.55,0:08:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我说的 两个街区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said, two blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你方向感这么差 一定老碰壁吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be hard with your sense of direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都想不出一句搭讪的好词儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}never being able to find your way to a decent pickup line.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你们过得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「孩子是最可爱的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Kids are the best"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你根本不喜欢小孩 - 我喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't even like kids. - I love kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.69,0:09:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说出三个你认识的小孩名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name three children that you even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今年有三名溺水者\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's the three drowning victims this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有6个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, six more,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在过去35年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}spread outover the past 35 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些尸体也都消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those bodies were never recovered, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果湖里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is something out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.31,0:09:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那它正在加快厮杀速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's picking up its pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说 就是有个湖怪在为非作歹\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got a lake monster on a binge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这湖怪理论有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole lake monster theory, it just bugs me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尼斯湖 恰普伦湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loch Ness, lake Champlain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.01,0:09:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都有成百上千的目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are literally hundreds of eyewitness accounts,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在这儿 没有任何目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}but here, almost nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管那是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人说的出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's living to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.01,0:09:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 巴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Barr,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯多佛·巴尔 我听过这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher Barr, where have I heard that name before?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯多佛·巴尔 五月份的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher Barr, the victim in may.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:09:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯多佛·巴尔是安德里亚的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christopher Barr was Andrea's husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.92,0:10:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas' father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.92,0:10:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他带卢卡斯去游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took Lucas out swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯溺水时 卢卡斯在一块浮木上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas was on a floating wooden platform when Chris drowned,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两小时后\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子才被救起\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the kid got rescued.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我们终于找到一名目击者了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we have an eyewitness after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪那孩子如此恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder that kid was so freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.31,0:10:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲眼见到父亲或母亲死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching one of your.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可不是那么容易忘怀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}parents die isn't something you just get over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.12,0:10:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能陪陪你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在陪我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.18,0:10:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能跟他打个招呼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I say hi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your friend this whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.05,0:10:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这套「甜心先生」的把戏 对我不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jerry maguire" Thing's not gonna work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.01,0:10:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他没那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that's what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.97,0:10:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画得怎么样啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.71,0:11:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前也爱玩这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I used to love these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你更喜欢蜡笔画\N{\fnArial\fs30}So crayons is more your thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.97,0:11:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很酷 小妞们都喜欢艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cool. Chicks dig artists.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.41,0:11:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, these are pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以坐下来陪你画一会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I sit and draw with you for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我画画也不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so bad myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你在听我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm thinking you can hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只是不想说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你爸爸到底经历了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know exactly what happened to your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我知道 那肯定很可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I know it was something real bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我了解你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我像你这么大时 也看到了一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was your age, I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.19,0:11:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.39,0:12:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你觉得没人会听你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you don't think anyone will listen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想让你知道 我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么都不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我画幅画就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}say anything. You could draw me a picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画出那天到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what you saw that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你爸爸身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.55,0:12:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在湖上发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.50,0:12:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.53,0:12:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.13,0:12:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我的怪人老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my geek brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我是个很烂的画家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so I'm a sucky artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.39,0:12:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you around, Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从他爸出事以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas hasn't said a word, not even to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯一言不发 跟我也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}not since his dad's accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.81,0:13:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我们听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the doctors saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}精神创伤后遗症\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it's a kind of post-traumatic stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一定不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}That can't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.33,0:13:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对你们两个来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}for either of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们搬去了我爸家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We moved in with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他帮了我们很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He helps out a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每当我想到卢卡斯所遭遇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I think about what Lucas went through,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.71,0:13:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he saw…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小孩子其实很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定会惊讶 他们能应对这些事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be surprised what they can deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 他过去就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he used to have such life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你说真的 以前很难和他相处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hard to keep up with, to tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.35,0:13:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在他就坐在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he just sits there,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}画画 和玩具兵一起游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}drawing those pictures, playing with those army men.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.00,0:14:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该吃点东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should probably eat something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去做晚饭 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make some dinner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该可以排除水怪的可能性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's safe to say we can rule out Nessie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚开车经过卡尔顿家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just drove past the Carlton house.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.74,0:16:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那有辆救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an ambulance there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔·卡尔顿死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will Carlton is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drowned?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.55,0:16:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 淹死在水槽里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, in the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.88,0:16:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这他妈怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你是对的 这不是个生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this isn't a creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在对付另外一种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dealing with something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.69,0:16:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 但是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.25,0:16:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许是个水鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A water wraith maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}某种恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 某种能控制水的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, something that controls water…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.02,0:16:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能控制从同一个源头来的水\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Water that comes from the Same source.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那个湖 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The lake - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.48,0:16:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就能解释为何它要加快杀人的速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}which would explain why it's upping the body count.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}湖水过几个月就会流干\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lake is draining.It'll be dry in a few months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.70,0:16:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管它是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever this thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.73,0:16:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不管它想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever it wants,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:16:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就快没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它能通过管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it can get through the pipes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就能找到任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can get to anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.45,0:17:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到达任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}悲剧将会很快重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna happen again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我们还确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we do know one other thing for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.30,0:17:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事一定和比尔·卡尔顿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know this has got something to do with Bill Carlton.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它杀了他的两个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took both his kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问了附近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've been asking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯的爸爸克里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas' dad, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是比尔·卡尔顿的教子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill Carlton's godson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.78,0:17:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去拜访一下卡尔顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go pay Mr. Carlton a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carlton?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能问你几个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to ask you a few questions,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.13,0:17:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不介意的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.88,0:17:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是野生动物管理局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're from the department.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无所谓你们从哪儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care who you're with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天回答的问题够多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've answered enough questions today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.48,0:17:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你儿子说他看见湖里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son said he saw something in that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.88,0:17:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看见过什么东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see anything out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carlton,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}索菲的溺水和威尔的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophie's drowning and Will's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们觉得或许\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think there might be a connection,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.75,0:17:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你或你们家有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you or your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我孩子都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My children are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.23,0:17:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse than dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.07,0:18:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go away…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.76,0:18:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得这个可怜的人受尽了折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the poor guy's been through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.62,0:18:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还觉得他有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also think he's not telling us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许比尔不是唯一知道真相的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Bill's not the only one who knows something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我觉得这不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, but I don't think it's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.12,0:18:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我必须得跟他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need to talk to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.28,0:18:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几分钟就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.51,0:18:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么都不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He won't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.61,0:18:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这么做有什么好处 - 安德里亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What good's it gonna do? - Andrea,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们认为 更多的人将被害\N{\fnArial\fs30}we think more people might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怕的事还在继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think something's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我丈夫 其他人 他们只是溺水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband, the others, they just drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.16,0:18:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你真的那么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you really believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}then we'll go,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you think there's even a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其他一丁点的可能性\N{\fnArial\fs30}that something else could be going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请让我跟您儿子谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}please let me talk to your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想谢谢你上次为我画的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to thank you for that last drawing…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…But the thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.85,0:19:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你再帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.20,0:20:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么会画出这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know to draw this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当时预感到有不好的事情要发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know something bad was gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}点头摇头\N{\fnArial\fs30}nod yes or no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.13,0:20:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来回答我\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我像你这么大时\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, when I was your age,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也看见在我妈妈身上发生的可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something real bad happen to my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.72,0:20:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那时也很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I was scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't feel like talking,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像你这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.03,0:20:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, see, my mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道她希望我勇敢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she wanted me to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我每天都这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think about that every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我尽量让自己变得更勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I do my best to be brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.89,0:21:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也希望你勇敢起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}wants you to be brave, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安德里亚说孩子在爸爸爸死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea said the kid never drew like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.93,0:21:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没画过这样的画\N{\fnArial\fs30}till his dad died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.01,0:21:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经有案例是这样 极度痛苦的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are cases going through a traumatic experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}导致当事人\N{\fnArial\fs30}could make certain people more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.35,0:21:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能预知未来和通灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}sensitive to premonitions, psychic tendencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.18,0:21:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是不是卢卡斯已经感觉到它了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Lucas is tapping into it somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一个人溺水不过是时间问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time before somebody else drowns,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你有头绪了 赶快说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you got a better lead, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.24,0:21:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.48,0:21:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得去找另一栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got another house to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.45,0:22:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}光这个镇上就有不下千栋的黄色两层房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's about a thousand yellow two-stories in this county alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}See this church?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我打赌附近可没有一千栋这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet there's less than a thousand of those around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.00,0:22:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大学生还觉得自己蛮聪明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, college boy thinks he's so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.15,0:22:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚刚说的有关妈的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, um… What you said about mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以前从来没跟我讲过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never told me that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天 我们不会要来个拥抱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god, we're not gonna have to hug or anything, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打搅你 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're sorry to bother you, madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请问有一个小男孩曾住在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but does a little boy live here by chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.66,0:23:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也许戴着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.78,0:23:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一顶蓝色的棒球帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}a blue ball cap,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.13,0:23:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑一辆红色的单车\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a red bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.86,0:23:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很久前就没住在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得失踪了35年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter's been gone 35 years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.37,0:23:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察从来没\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police never.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.24,0:23:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had any idea what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.25,0:23:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就这么消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失去他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.91,0:23:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那 那让我生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's… It's worse than dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.51,0:23:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是在这失踪的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he disappear from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.33,0:23:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 在这栋房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, from this house?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.39,0:23:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他本该\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在放学后\N{\fnArial\fs30}ride his bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骑着他的单车\N{\fnArial\fs30}straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}径直回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}after school,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.62,0:23:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他再也没出现过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he never showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得·斯威尼和比利·卡尔顿 1970年\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peter Sweeney and Billy Carlton, 1970."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.51,0:24:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你带走了所有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've taken everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.57,0:24:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一无所有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.32,0:24:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过去不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.97,0:24:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.14,0:24:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我终于知道了你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I finally know what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个小男孩 彼得·斯威尼失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this little boy, Peter Sweeney, vanishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.26,0:25:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的线索都跟比尔·卡尔顿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is all connected to Bill Carlton somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.63,0:25:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比尔肯定隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill sure as hell seems to be hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.62,0:25:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且这个比尔 所有他爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bill, the people he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.19,0:25:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全都遭到惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're all getting punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.24,0:25:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是说比尔对彼得做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that Bill did something to Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.87,0:25:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是比尔杀了他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if Bill killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.49,0:25:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得的灵魂一定很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter's spirit would be furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它想报仇 这有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd want revenge. It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.77,0:25:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carlton!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.45,0:25:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.77,0:25:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卡尔顿先生 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Carlton! You need to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.14,0:25:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开那湖 快掉头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out of the water! Turn the boat around!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.53,0:25:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.17,0:25:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没想到你们会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.43,0:26:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们现在混得挺熟了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you're on a first-name basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.47,0:26:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.66,0:26:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我给你带来了晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought you dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.21,0:26:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 甜心 我现在没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sweetheart. I don't really have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说比尔·卡尔顿的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about Bill Carlton.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.24,0:26:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真的吗 湖里真有什么东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true? Is something going on with the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.58,0:26:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们还不清楚事情的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, we don't know what the truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我觉得你还是带卢卡斯回家比较好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think it might be better if you and lucas went on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.04,0:26:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, hey, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.01,0:26:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 卢卡斯 - 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lucas. - Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.65,0:26:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 没事的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, it's okay. It's okay. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.12,0:26:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 没事的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, it's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.02,0:27:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 只是想确定一下 你们看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just so I'm clear, you see…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}something…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.79,0:27:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}袭击了比尔的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}attack Bill's boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.79,0:27:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}sending Bill,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.40,0:27:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个游泳健将\N{\fnArial\fs30}who is a very good swimmer, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.07,0:27:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拖到了湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.19,0:27:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你们再也没见他上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you never see him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.27,0:27:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 大概就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that about sums it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.85,0:27:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该相信这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm supposed to believe this,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.40,0:27:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我用声纳搜索了整个湖底\N{\fnArial\fs30}even though I've already sonar-swept that entire lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.54,0:27:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你们的描述难以让人信服\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what you're describing is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.51,0:27:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且你们根本不是野生动物管理局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're not really Wildlife Service?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.18,0:27:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.17,0:27:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}局里从来没听说过你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The department's never heard of you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.10,0:27:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们可以解释 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, we can explain that. - Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.76,0:27:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.98,0:27:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们还没被抓起来的唯一原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only reason you're breathing free air.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.61,0:27:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是比尔的一个邻居\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one of Bill's neighbors saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.11,0:27:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你们之前看见了他驾船出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}him steering out that boat just before you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在有几个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have a couple of options here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.96,0:27:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以冒充政府官员的名义逮捕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can arrest you for impersonating government officials.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.17,0:27:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把你们作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hold you as material.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.48,0:27:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比尔·卡尔顿失踪案的人证扣押起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}witnesses to Bill Carlton's disappearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.02,0:27:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者\N{\fnArial\fs30}or.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.14,0:28:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就当今天走了霉运\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can chalk this all up to a bad day,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.23,0:28:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get into your car,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.83,0:28:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上从这儿离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}you put this town in your rearview mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.72,0:28:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远也不要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't ever darken my doorstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远\N{\fnArial\fs30}again!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.34,0:28:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二种选择听起来不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door number two sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.16,0:28:16.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是我 也选这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the one I'd pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.59,0:28:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.43,0:28:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么晚了你在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.78,0:28:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 睡觉去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.83,0:29:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绿灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.97,0:29:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}变绿灯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light's green.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.46,0:29:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到另一个州了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, the interstate's the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.32,0:29:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.22,0:29:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 这事儿已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dean, this job, I think it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.69,0:29:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.58,0:29:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是比尔谋杀了彼得·斯威尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}If bill murdered Peter Sweeney.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.60,0:29:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而彼得的灵魂也报了仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Peter's spirit got its revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情就了结了 他的灵魂也该安息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}case closed. The spirit should be at rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.90,0:29:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们走了事情还没结束怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so what if we take off and this thing isn't done?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.51,0:29:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万一我们漏掉了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we missed something?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.61,0:29:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}致使更多人受害怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if more people get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.61,0:29:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么要那样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.01,0:29:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为卢卡斯太害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Lucas was really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.95,0:29:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.40,0:30:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}确定那孩子没事之前我不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want to leave town till I know the kid's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.30,0:30:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我哥哥做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what have you done with my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.05,0:31:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定这么做吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.83,0:31:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夜深了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty late, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.45,0:31:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas? Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.86,0:31:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.86,0:32:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能告诉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.05,0:32:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.96,0:32:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这根本说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.76,0:32:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.31,0:32:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.26,0:32:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.04,0:32:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.17,0:33:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.27,0:33:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得我听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I heard…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.31,0:33:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was this voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.64,0:33:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.66,0:33:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它说 「来和我玩」\N{\fnArial\fs30}it said, "Come play with me."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.71,0:33:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能认出照片里的这些孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recognize the kids in these pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.44,0:33:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.10,0:33:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不全认得\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I huh…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.07,0:33:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, except that's my dad right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.39,0:33:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他那时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have been about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.37,0:33:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概12岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 in these pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.62,0:34:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯·巴尔的溺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris Barr's drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.26,0:34:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅只跟比尔·卡尔顿有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}the connection wasn't to Bill Carlton.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.60,0:34:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定还跟治安官有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have been to sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.69,0:34:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比尔和治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill and the sheriff,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们肯定跟彼得的死有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were both involved with Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.39,0:34:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于克里斯的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Chris?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.03,0:34:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸爸 你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.42,0:34:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.67,0:34:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.60,0:34:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和卢卡斯回屋里去 别出来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Lucas get back to the house and stay there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.34,0:35:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得的自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter's bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.39,0:35:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.84,0:35:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放下枪 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the gun down, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.03,0:35:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道它在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.05,0:35:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和比尔杀了彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bill killed Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.49,0:35:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把尸体扔进湖里 然后埋了自行车\N{\fnArial\fs30}drowned him in the lake, and then buried the bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.29,0:35:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你掩埋不了真相 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't bury the truth, Jake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.19,0:35:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纸包不住火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing stays buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.39,0:35:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去你的房间呆着 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your room, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.17,0:35:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.06,0:35:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}锁上门等着我 不要出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the door and wait for me. Don't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.67,0:35:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}35年前 你和比尔杀了彼得·斯威尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Bill killed Peter Sweeney 35 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.18,0:35:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是我要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what the hell I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.11,0:35:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.00,0:35:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你要面对一个愤怒发狂的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you got one seriously pissed-off spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.13,0:35:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会杀了安德里亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take Andrea,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.49,0:35:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.57,0:35:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爱的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone you love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.06,0:35:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会把他们淹死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna drown them,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他们拖到谁也找不到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's gonna drag their bodies god knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.70,0:35:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就可以感受到彼得的妈妈所遭受的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can feel the Same pain Peter's mom felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.83,0:35:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.02,0:35:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它会杀掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's gonna take you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.38,0:35:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}未达目的前 它不会罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not gonna stop until it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.17,0:36:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为这就是它对比尔·卡尔顿所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's exactly what it did to Bill Carlton.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.67,0:36:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听听你们都说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to yourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.07,0:36:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.74,0:36:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.91,0:36:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本不在乎你对我们的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't really give a rat's ass what you think of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.11,0:36:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是如果我们要干掉这个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if we're gonna bring down this spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.97,0:36:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就得找到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to find the remains,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.79,0:36:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给它撒上盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}salt them,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.74,0:36:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后把它烧成灰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and burn them into dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.07,0:36:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 你把彼得埋在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you buried Peter somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.60,0:36:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说你就是把它扔进了湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you didn't just let him go in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.70,0:36:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来和我玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.26,0:36:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.89,0:36:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们说的都是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is any of this true?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.95,0:36:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 别听他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.23,0:36:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是骗子 而且很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're liars, and they're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.69,0:36:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有东西想要淹死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}something tried to drown me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.86,0:36:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里斯死在了那个湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chris died on that lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.18,0:36:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.64,0:36:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.37,0:36:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.79,0:36:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.96,0:36:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比利和我当时在湖边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy and I were at the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.53,0:37:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得个子最小 我们总是欺负他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter was the smallest one. We always bullied him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.69,0:37:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this time…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.06,0:37:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不幸发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.09,0:37:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把他的头按在水里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were holding his head under the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.62,0:37:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't mean to,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.71,0:37:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我们按得太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we held him under too long,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.52,0:37:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他淹死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.72,0:37:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把尸体进湖里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We let the body go,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.75,0:37:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它就沉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.89,0:37:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安德里亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Andrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.23,0:37:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们当时只是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.90,0:37:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们怕得要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.82,0:37:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.86,0:37:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 安德里亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, Andrea,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.00,0:37:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说我跟这些溺水的人有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}to say that I have anything to do with these drownings,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.44,0:37:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟克里斯有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Chris,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.99,0:37:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就因为什么鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of some ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.92,0:37:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那太不理性了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not rational.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.49,0:37:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.26,0:37:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们家所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.88,0:38:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得立刻带你们离开这个湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you away from this lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.48,0:38:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能走多远走多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as we can right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.05,0:38:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.45,0:38:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来和我玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.40,0:38:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.38,0:38:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 呆在那别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas! Stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.63,0:38:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安德里亚呆在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.96,0:38:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Lucas!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.09,0:38:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会找到他的 呆在码头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get him. Stay on the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.67,0:38:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.36,0:38:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.06,0:38:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.88,0:39:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你能听见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can hear me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.81,0:39:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}please, Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.78,0:39:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.02,0:39:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我非常 - 爸爸 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so… - Dad, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.89,0:39:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.46,0:39:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他只是个小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's j… he's just a little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.11,0:39:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 那不是他的错 都是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, it's not his fault. It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.33,0:39:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please take me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.51,0:39:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jake,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.12,0:39:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 让一切都结束吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, let it be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.49,0:39:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.01,0:39:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.37,0:39:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.23,0:39:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.95,0:40:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不可能救每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're not gonna save everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.46,0:40:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.90,0:40:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.03,0:40:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.34,0:40:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴你们还没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're glad we caught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.94,0:40:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们做了路上吃的午餐给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just, um, we made you lunch for the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.31,0:40:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢卡斯一定要亲自做三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucas insisted on making the sandwiches himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.52,0:40:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能把东西给他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I give it to them now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.49,0:40:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.32,0:40:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 卢卡斯 我们把这个放到车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lucas, let's load this in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.76,0:41:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.14,0:41:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这需要很长一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just gonna take a long.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.27,0:41:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来忘记这事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}time to sort through everything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.01,0:41:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安德里亚 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.20,0:41:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们救了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.19,0:41:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能要求更多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't ask for more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.60,0:41:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸很爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad loved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.59,0:41:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很爱卢卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}He loved Lucas.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.83,0:41:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.85,0:41:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.73,0:41:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}hold on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.97,0:41:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.95,0:41:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你现在又开始讲话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're gonna be talking now,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.72,0:41:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是句很重要的短语\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a very important phrase,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.04,0:41:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想让你再重复一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I want you to repeat it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.92,0:41:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}柏林飞艇 最牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zeppelin rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.88,0:41:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好样的 击掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.97,0:41:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好好照顾你妈妈 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your mom, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.59,0:42:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, move your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.26,0:42:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再不走天就黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna run out of daylight before we hit the road.
